  "details": "I have a slower connection and having lots of people in one instance takes me sometimes up to 30 minutes until everyones avatar is loaded. And when someone switches their avatar while it still loads, vrchat doesnt know what avatar to use and it messes up. So when that happens the wrong avatar is loaded. A possible fix to that could be that if an avatar ist still loading and the player switches it, the loading gets canceled and the other avatar starts downloading",
